   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Present a claim",
   "texto": [
    "**Begrunnelse** is the explanation of the reasons. **Innsigelse** is a formal objection. **Vedlegg** is a document added to a letter or request.",
    "In a formal letter, it indicates to which decision you refer, explains the reason and encloses the relevant documentation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Exceptional subordinates",
   "texto": [
    "**Med mindre** means «unless» and has an exception: **Saken avsluttes ikke med mindre nye opplysninger kommer fram**.",
    "After **dersom** («si») and **med mindre**, the subordinate keeps the order subject + verb."
   ]
  },
